t the movie and you can  see his inner turmoil play out on his  face he has no love in his heart for his  father but he also can't let him die  he's even more conflicted because  quarrich just gave up Tuck to save his  son's life looked at in this way  spider's actions make sense he's  begrudged repaying a debt and avoiding  patricide but it's clear he would have  rather simply not found courage at all  even so it's hard to imagine the sillies  being thrilled when they find out what  spider has done  Avatar the way of water is a story about  family Jake grapples with his  responsibilities as a father and feels  torn between his desire to fight and his  need to protect his children natiri  faces a similar dilemma as she's pulled  between her duties as a mother and her  larger Community however it's not the  parents who take Center Spotlight at the  end of way of water but the children  they're the ones who saved the day and  lead the way home using her ability to  compel the natural forces of Pandora to  obey her Kiri locates where Jake natiri  and tuck are trapped under the wreckage  of the ship she finds her mother and  sister and leads them out while loac  goes to find his father exhausted from  his battle with quarrich and panicking  at the rising water Jake tells his son  to leave him behind convinced he can't  hold his breath long enough to get out  but loac refuses to hear it bringing the  lessons of the film full circle he  encourages his father to calm himself  teaching him the same slow breathing  technique he learned from Soraya safely  away from the wreckage Jake places his  hand on his son and Echoes soraya's line  I see and for the first time he truly  does one of the big mysteries in avatar  The Way of water is Kiri and her special  powers born from the dead Avatar body of  Dr Grace Augustine Kiri grows up not  knowing who her father was or how she  came to be she tries to learn these  answers by communing with the metcaine's  spirit tree but a seizure cuts her visit  short here's what we know for sure  Carrie has an uncanny connection to AWA  and the natural forces of Pandora and no  one knew that Grace was pregnant until  after she was dead given these Clues  it's possible that the father mystery is  a red herring and that Kiri was an  Immaculate Conception created within  Grace's Avatar by AWA that would explain  how she can hear a was heartbeat as she  tells Jake and it would make her  incredibly important to the story going  forward of course there's no proof yet  that this is the case but it seems  likely Kiri is unique among all the  other Navi and she could be downright  Messianic after the battle with the RDA  ends and natayam is laid to rest Jake  tells tonawari that he and his family  will be moving on you'd think the chief  would be glad to see them go even the  amount of Destruction they brought to  his realm but he's not he encourages  Jake to stay telling him that his whole  family is now part of the Met kaina clan  in his closing narration Jake reveals  that he's decided to stay he says that  he can't save his family by running and  he's right running didn't stop the RDA  from finding him and it didn't stop  nateam from dying so with a new and  Powerful Ally at his back Jake decides  to stay and make his stand by the sea  what exactly this means for the Avatar  sequels is unclear will likely continue  exploring new locations and subcultures  on Pandora but the Met kaina will likely  remain Central to the plot a return to  the forests of the omatakaya would also  make sense given natiri's Heritage like  its predecessor Avatar the way of water  is largely about the balance of the  natural world this theme is channeled  into the cultural and spiritual beliefs  of the navi and the way of water adds  another interesting layer in the form of  the Tolkien showing another  hyper-intelligent species on Pandora is  a great way to further develop the  complex ecosystem of the world and it  further contrasts 