 cuts her visit  short here's what we know for sure  Carrie has an uncanny connection to AWA  and the natural forces of Pandora and no  one knew that Grace was pregnant until  after she was dead given these Clues  it's possible that the father mystery is  a red herring and that Kiri was an  Immaculate Conception created within  Grace's Avatar by AWA that would explain  how she can hear a was heartbeat as she  tells Jake and it would make her  incredibly important to the story going  forward of course there's no proof yet  that this is the case but it seems  likely Kiri is unique among all the  other Navi and she could be downright  Messianic after the battle with the RDA  ends and natayam is laid to rest Jake  tells tonawari that he and his family  will be moving on you'd think the chief  would be glad to see them go even the  amount of Destruction they brought to  his realm but he's not he encourages  Jake to stay telling him that his whole  family is now part of the Met kaina clan  in his closing narration Jake reveals  that he's decided to stay he says that  he can't save his family by running and  he's right running didn't stop the RDA  from finding him and it didn't stop  nateam from dying so with a new and  Powerful Ally at his back Jake decides  to stay and make his stand by the sea  what exactly this means for the Avatar  sequels is unclear will likely continue  exploring new locations and subcultures  on Pandora but the Met kaina will likely  remain Central to the plot a return to  the forests of the omatakaya would also  make sense given natiri's Heritage like  its predecessor Avatar the way of water  is largely about the balance of the  natural world this theme is channeled  into the cultural and spiritual beliefs  of the navi and the way of water adds  another interesting layer in the form of  the Tolkien showing another  hyper-intelligent species on Pandora is  a great way to further develop the  complex ecosystem of the world and it  further contrasts the ways of the navi  with those of their human oppressors  it's particularly telling that the main  thing sought by the RDA in the film The  Brain fluid from the Tolkien stops human  aging it's a tangible affront to the  natural cycle of life and death that the  navi holds so sacred quarrich Ardmore  and the rest of the human forces  continue to represent imperialism and  environmental destruction on the largest  scale the RDA is run by company men only  interested in the bottom line even at  claims of Humanity's dire circumstances  become more prevalent Earth is dying but  the RDA is still just trying to make  money it would be interesting to see how  the action on Pandora is pitched to  regular citizens and how they feel about  the moon's occupation way of water also  suggests that as in our world the fight  for the environment is being led by the  youth it's fun to see the young Navi  taking charge and it should be exciting  to watch them grow with the franchise  unlike humans they understand that the  value of the natural world is greater  than what we can take from it  the third Avatar film has already been  shot and is planned for release in 2024  according to Cameron and after the  events of the way of water there are a  lot of places it could go this time  humanity is still on Pandora in between  the movies and general Ardmore will  surely want revenge for the destruction  of her valuable whaling vessel with  colonization now the ultimate goal of  Humanity's presence on Pandora more and  more powerful tools of occupation are  surely on their way the navi and their  allies will have to join forces to stand  a chance fortunately they now have Kiri  on their side whose unique abilities  we've likely only scratched the surface  of she could become the key to freeing  the moon for good but she's still just  figuring out the limits of her abilities  and of course quarrich will be back to  continue his spiteful Vengeance Quest  against Jake and his family maybe he'll  reconsider his position after being  rescued by spider but given how outright  evil he is that seems a long way off  spider himself still seems smitten with  Kiri and loac and Reya are building a  solid foundation for a long-term  relationship these romantic threads may  become more important as the care  characters continue to age Avatar the  way of water is a huge step up from its  predecessor and with luck the next film  will be even better  [Music]
 

